<p>Requires Disk 3 of the original game. Disk 1 and Disk 2, the intro, are optional: given both, the game boots from Disk 1, and the intro asks for Disk 2, then Disk 3, in DF0.</p>
<h2>Controls</h2>
<div class="key"><span class="label">Mouse</span><span class="state">the game is played with the mouse</span></div>
